Facts in this repository come from two sources.

Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/): CC0 1.0 Universal.

United Nations Treaty Collection (https://treaties.un.org/): the treaty names and the dates of treaty actions are facts. No other text from the UN pages is reproduced. Source credit: United Nations Treaty Collection, status pages of multilateral treaties deposited with the Secretary-General.

This repository holds no law text.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
